      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Traffic Analysis"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Packet sizes, timing and direction stay visible",
            "That alone names which page of a site you loaded",
            "Which video you streamed, which app you are running",
            "Total bytes and duration fingerprint odd workloads"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "JA3 / JA4",
          "items": [
            "Fingerprint from cipher and extension ordering",
            "Derived straight from your ClientHello",
            "Identifies your TLS stack, often the exact app or bot"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Session IDs vs Tickets"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Mechanism",
            "State lives",
            "Fleet-friendly?"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "Session ID",
              "server cache",
              "needs shared cache"
            ],
            [
              "Ticket (RFC 5077)",
              "client blob",
              "**stateless**"
            ],
            [
              "TLS 1.3 PSK",
              "NewSessionTicket",
              "stateless"
            ]
          ],
          "highlightRow": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. The Ticket Key"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "One ==ticket key== encrypts **every** ticket",
            "Leak it and past sessions decrypt retroactively",
            "Rotate every few hours, not months",
            "Keep it in memory — many defaults never rotate"
          ],
          "style": "checkbox"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. 0-RTT Replay"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Early data carries no server freshness",
            "An attacker can capture and re-send it",
            "Never send POST or payments as ==early data==",
            "Servers: idempotent only, or an anti-replay window"
          ],
          "style": "cross"
        }
      ]
    },
